# The image build needs the manifests, the TypeScript sources and the oclif
# entrypoint. Everything else in this repo is irrelevant to it: docs/ holds a redoc
# bundle the image never serves, test-fixtures/ holds parity fixtures that are mounted
# in rather than baked, and .claude/worktrees/ holds full checkouts of the repo.
#
# Written as an allowlist — exclude everything, then re-include exactly what the
# Dockerfile COPYs — so a new top-level directory cannot silently inflate the build
# context. A pattern added here must have a matching COPY in the Dockerfile.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!docs/package.json
!tsconfig.json
!index.ts
!bin
!lib
!cli
